'''Vaporeon''' (Japanese: '''シャワーズ''' ''Showers'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

