*'''Hyper Whirlpool''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX FireRed & LeafGreen|Blastoise ex|104}} from the {{TCG|EX FireRed & LeafGreen}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

